ASSIGNMA , AIR VOID
ASSIGNMA , AIR OUT
ASSIGNMA , VACUUM DRIVER
ASSIGNMA , VACUUM SOLENOID,,, 1
ASSIGNMA , VACUUM BEAML1
ASSIGNMA , VACUUM BEAML2
ASSIGNMA , VACUUM BEAML3
ASSIGNMA , Inconel_ TRG,,, 1
MGNCREAT FMCYLIN 100,,,,,,,,, 2 2,, 0 -100,, 70 100
MGNDATA FMCYLIN 1 4 1 4 1 4 1 4
!MGNFIELD FMCYLIN,,,, OUT
!MGNFIELD FMCYLIN,,,, DRIVER
MGNFIELD FMCYLIN,,,, SOLENOID
MGNFIELD FMCYLIN,,,, TRG
!MGNFIELD FMCYLIN,,,, BEAML1
!MGNFIELD FMCYLIN,,,, BEAML2
!MGNFIELD FMCYLIN,,,, BEAML3
USERDUMP dump 100 21 0 1
*..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
*Set the random number seed
RANDOMIZ , 1.0
*Set the number of primary histories to be simulated in the run
START
STOP
